Hooks: Config validation not enforced at load time

Closed as a duplicate of B801 ("Hooks: Config validation not enforced at load
time"), which is done. Both were filed 2026-08-02 within 18 seconds of each
other (05:21:32 and 05:21:50) by a batch whose ID allocator restarted at B001 —
this file carried the duplicate id B001 until it was renumbered to B815.

B801's fix is live: src/agent_turn_setup.ml runs Hooks.validate_all_hooks over
project/profile/config hook sources at load time and logs each validation error.